WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.222
Living non-bird reptiles include squamates, turtles, crocodilians, and tuatara.
现生非鸟类爬行动物主要包括有鳞类、龟类、鳄类和喙头蜥。

2
00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:17.204
Squamates include lizards, snakes, and worm lizards.
有鳞类包括蜥蜴、蛇和蚓蜥。

3
00:00:17.204 --> 00:00:23.418
Crocodiles and alligators are both crocodilians.
鳄和短吻鳄都属于鳄类。

4
00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:30.616
Tuatara look like lizards, but belong to a different ancient group.
喙头蜥看起来像蜥蜴，但属于另一个古老类群。

5
00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:40.790
Reptiles live in forests, deserts, grasslands, wetlands, rivers, and seas.
爬行动物生活在森林、沙漠、草原、湿地、河流和海洋等多种环境中。

6
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:47.820
Native reptiles occur on every continent except Antarctica.
除南极洲外，各大洲都有本土爬行动物。

7
00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:54.010
Reptile diets vary from species to species.
不同种类爬行动物的食性各不相同。

8
00:00:54.010 --> 00:01:02.096
Some eat animals, some are omnivores, and some mainly eat plants.
有的吃动物，有的杂食，还有的主要吃植物。

9
00:01:02.096 --> 00:01:10.614
Dinosaurs are part of the reptile family tree, and birds are living dinosaurs.
恐龙属于爬行动物演化家族树，鸟类是仍然存活的恐龙。

10
00:01:10.614 --> 00:01:18.076
Watch wild reptiles from a safe distance and never touch a wild snake.
请与野生爬行动物保持安全距离，绝不要触摸野生蛇类。
